    "heading": "Proficiency Bonus",
    "lineStart": 198,
    "lineEnd": 200
  },
  "section": "1.19",
  "rulesText": "You add your Proficiency Bonus to your attack roll when you attack using a weapon you have proficiency with, as well as when you attack with a spell. See “Proficiency” later in “Playing the Game” for more information about weapon proficiencies."
}
